ned to deliver range detection with cost efficiency and installation flexibility for behind-the-windshield, rooftop or front grille integration; and perception application, a software application that turns raw point cloud data into perception ready outputs designed to serve as functionally safe software into a vehicle's driving platform stack. The company operates in Europe, the Asia Pacific, the Middle East, Africa, Israel, and North America. It markets and sells its products through a direct sales organization, as well as distribution channels. Innoviz Technologies Ltd. is headquartered in Rosh HaAyin, Israel."}}